  "text": "# GETTING STARTED  \n**Q: How do I open an account?**\nA: Visit www.firstuk.bank/open-account to start online (fastest), or call 0800-555-2265.  \n**Q: What's the first step?**\nA: Choose a product (SmartSaver, Current, or Mortgage) and click \"Open Account.\"  \n**Q: When can I use my account?**\nA: Immediately after opening (online/branch), or 5–7 days (postal).  \n---",
